ong>\u00a0Provide continuous effects just by being placed in the inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstruction</strong>\u00a0Mostly created by enemies to disrupt your gameplay.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s core thrill lies in combining these five card types for maximum synergy. With each victory, you earn inventory fragments to expand your space and collect new cards, adding layers of strategy as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras/00140e6126f1d5cb71379580ce5ceb2b.avif?t=1772441405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras_big/00140e6126f1d5cb71379580ce5ceb2b.avif?t=1772441405 width=800 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inventory as a Cost</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Pocket Legend</i>, you can freely arrange tools within your inventory. The inventory itself acts as the cost system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >World Concept</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras/ba633776b98964f478dda6a93c2c6edc.avif?t=1772441405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras_big/ba633776b98964f478dda6a93c2c6edc.avif?t=1772441405 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player is transported to the world of &quot;Lumensia&quot; and gains the power of the &quot;Inventory.&quot; This leads them to become entangled in major events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pocket Legend</i> features a wide array of legendary weapons, including Gram, Fridwen, Gae Bolg, Arondight, Levatein, Tyrfing, and Failnaught. These captivating legendary tools are imbued with souls, allowing them to bond with the player and join them on an adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras/ca9bf166b9d2d098f299d67ee152d983.avif?t=1772441405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras_big/ca9bf166b9d2d098f299d67ee152d983.avif?t=1772441405 width=800 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras/0210112fcaa4d25a7923803fe20ff251.avif?t=1772441405\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/extras_big/0210112fcaa4d25a7923803fe20ff251.avif?t=1772441405 width=800 height=156 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Blitz conquer the formidable foes known as the 'Tanebra' and find a way back to their own world? Dive into <i>Pocket Legend</i> to discover the fate that awaits!</p>","developers":["Shading Box"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3129790/00b19f716d61ddc932fe3af2f787da9c016192e5/header.jpg?t=1772441405","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Shading Box. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nShading Box is registered in South Korea under company number 642-88-03231.<br />\r\nVAT Number: 642-88-03231.<br />\r\nFor inquiries, contact us at: mnpshino@gmail.com or 82)10-2678-0286.<br />\r\nPrivacy Policy | Terms of Service","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3129790/1364376469/2c046aa8408426ac